# Fixture: a state-scoped ensure — outside the obligation enumerator's
# surface today; must surface as a named record, never silently.
precept EnsureFixture

field Total as decimal default 0.0

state Active initial
state Closed terminal

in Active ensure Total >= 0 because "balance floor"

event Open initial
on Open -> set Total = 10

event Close
from Active on Close -> transition Closed
